{"id":"person_chen_jiageng","type":"person","title":"陈嘉庚","aliases":["陳嘉庚","Tan Kah Kee"],"years":"1874-10-21–1961-08-12","roles":["福建华侨","南洋华商","教育事业","侨社领袖"],"summary":"福建集美人，1890年前往新加坡经商，后长期参与南洋华侨社群与教育公益事业。其在家乡持续兴学，1913年创办集美小学，1921年创办厦门大学，形成跨新加坡与闽南两地的重要华侨教育网络。","origin":"福建集美","eventIds":["event_cjk_birth","event_cjk_singapore_1890","event_cjk_jimei_school_1913","event_cjk_xmu_1921","event_cjk_hokkien_chair_1929"],"placeIds":["place_jimei","place_singapore","place_xiamen"],"orgIds":["org_jimei_schools","org_xiamen_university","org_singapore_hokkien_huay_kuan"],"sourceIds":["SRC-CJK-XMU-ADMISSIONS","SRC-CJK-XMU-JGXY","SRC-CJK-TKKF","SRC-CJK-NLB-IMG"],"imageStatus":"external_reference_not_published_pending_rights","reviewStatus":"reviewed","completionLevel":"usable","familyIds":[],"documentIds":[],"qiaopiIds":[]}
{"id":"person_li_guangqian","type":"person","title":"李光前","aliases":["李光前","Lee Kong Chian"],"years":"1893–1967","roles":["福建南安","新加坡华商","慈善教育","银行业"],"summary":"福建南安芙蓉人，1903年随父赴新加坡。1916年进入陈嘉庚企业学习橡胶贸易，后成为重要工商与银行人物，1932年参与推动三家银行合并形成华侨银行，并于1952年创立李氏基金，长期资助教育和公共事业。","origin":"福建南安","eventIds":["event_lkc_birth","event_lkc_singapore_1903","event_lkc_tkk_1916","event_lkc_ocbc_1932","event_lkc_foundation_1952","event_lkc_library_1953"],"placeIds":["place_furong_nanan","place_singapore"],"orgIds":["org_tan_kah_kee_rubber","org_ocbc","org_lee_foundation","org_national_library_singapore"],"sourceIds":["SRC-LKC-NLB-BIBLIO","SRC-LKC-NUS-BENEFACTOR","SRC-LKC-NLB-FELLOWSHIP","SRC-LKC-OCBC","SRC-LKC-NUS-LEEFOUNDATION","SRC-LKC-NLB-LIBRARY"],"imageStatus":"external_reference_not_published_pending_rights","reviewStatus":"reviewed","completionLevel":"usable","familyIds":[],"documentIds":[],"qiaopiIds":[]}
{"id":"person_hu_wenhu","type":"person","title":"胡文虎","aliases":["胡文虎","Aw Boon Haw"],"years":"1882–1954","roles":["福建祖籍","东南亚华商","虎标万金油","报业"],"summary":"1882年生于仰光，家族祖籍福建。胡文虎与弟胡文豹经营并推广虎标万金油，1926年把事业重心迁至新加坡，并进一步扩展报业、银行与慈善活动。1937年为胡文豹建成虎豹别墅，成为其商业与文化记忆的重要地标。","origin":"福建祖籍（具体村落待核）","eventIds":["event_aw_birth","event_aw_tigerbalm_1909","event_aw_singapore_1926","event_aw_sinchew_1929","event_aw_villa_1937","event_aw_death_1954"],"placeIds":["place_yangon","place_fujian_ancestral_aw","place_singapore"],"orgIds":["org_haw_par","org_sin_chew_jit_poh"],"sourceIds":["SRC-AWH-NLB-GUIDE","SRC-AWH-NLB-BIBLIO","SRC-AWH-HAWPAR","SRC-AWH-NAS-VILLA"],"imageStatus":"external_reference_not_published_pending_rights","reviewStatus":"reviewed","completionLevel":"usable","familyIds":[],"documentIds":[],"qiaopiIds":[]}
{"id":"person_huang_naishang","type":"person","title":"黄乃裳","aliases":["黃乃裳","Wong Nai Siong","Huang Naishang","黄九美","黄慕华"],"years":"1849-07-25–1924-09-22","roles":["福建闽清","新加坡","诗巫新福州","华侨迁徙"],"summary":"福建闽清人，清末民初华侨领袖和社会活动家。1899年前往新加坡并从事报业，随后赴砂拉越诗巫推动福州移民开垦，形成“新福州”移民社群；后继续参与革命与公共事务，其经历连接福建、新加坡和婆罗洲。","origin":"福建闽清","eventIds":["event_wns_birth","event_wns_reform_1895","event_wns_singapore_1899","event_wns_sibu_settlement","event_wns_tongmenghui_1906","event_wns_death_1924"],"placeIds":["place_minqing","place_singapore","place_sibu"],"orgIds":["org_jit_shin_pau","org_new_foochow_settlement_company","org_chinese_revolutionary_alliance"],"sourceIds":["SRC-WNS-MINQING-GOV","SRC-WNS-NLB-GUIDE","SRC-WNS-WIKIDATA"],"imageStatus":"external_reference_not_published_pending_rights","reviewStatus":"reviewed","completionLevel":"usable","familyIds":[],"documentIds":[],"qiaopiIds":[]}
{"id":"person_rong_hong","type":"person","title":"容闳","aliases":["容閎","Yung Wing"],"years":"1828-11-17–1912-04-21","roles":["广东香山","留美教育","耶鲁","中美交流"],"summary":"广东香山南屏人，1847年前往美国求学，1850年进入耶鲁学院并于1854年毕业，成为首位从美国大学毕业的中国学生。其后推动中国留美幼童教育计划，长期参与中美教育交流与近代中国教育改革。","origin":"广东香山南屏","eventIds":["event_yw_birth","event_yw_us_1847","event_yw_yale_1850","event_yw_grad_1854","event_yw_cem_1870s"],"placeIds":["place_nanping_xiangshan","place_united_states","place_new_haven"],"orgIds":["org_yale_university"],"sourceIds":["SRC-YW-YALE-MACMILLAN","SRC-YW-YALE-2004","SRC-YW-WSU","SRC-YW-GUTENBERG"],"imageStatus":"external_reference_not_published_pending_rights","reviewStatus":"reviewed","completionLevel":"usable","familyIds":[],"documentIds":[],"qiaopiIds":[]}
